\section{Principal Evidence Products}
The report relies on the following primary visual products and quantitative tables:
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=2em]
    \item Stage 1 KDE maps (Figure~\ref{fig:stage1kde}): \url{<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_ridgecrest_spatiotemporal_evolution/figures/stage1_kde_page_01.png}
    \item Stage 2 KDE maps (Figures~\ref{fig:stage2kde1} and \ref{fig:stage2kde2}): \url{<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_ridgecrest_spatiotemporal_evolution/figures/stage2_kde_page_01.png} and \url{<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_ridgecrest_spatiotemporal_evolution/figures/stage2_kde_page_02.png}
    \item Stage 1 and Stage 2 hotspot tracks (Figures~\ref{fig:stage1hotspot} and \ref{fig:stage2hotspot})
    \item Convex-hull and alpha-shape evolution figures (Figures~\ref{fig:convex} and \ref{fig:alpha})
    \item Stage comparison summary: \url{<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_ridgecrest_spatiotemporal_evolution/tables/stage_comparison_summary.csv}
    \item Interval-by-interval KDE summary: \url{<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_ridgecrest_spatiotemporal_evolution/tables/kde_interval_summary.csv}
    \item Hourly morphology summary: \url{<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_ridgecrest_spatiotemporal_evolution/tables/morphology_interval_summary.csv}
